Oyeb
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
DROGEN 8 FACE_ALL
DROGEN 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE DROGEN DROGEN
OR
    AND
        SRC Suit {HEARTS, CLUBS}
        DEST Size >= 10
    AND
        DEST Rank K
        DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
MOVE_STACK DROGEN DROGEN
SRCSTACK Rank ascending
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DROGEN Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL DROGEN Empty
        PILE ALL DROGEN Empty
